    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanyuma twarahindukiye dufata inzira iduga ija i Bashani, maze Ogi umwami w’i Bashani n’ingabo ziwe zose baza kudutegera kugira ngo tugwanire ahitwa Edireyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " arambarira ati: “Ntimumutinye kuko namutanze mu maboko yanyu, we n’ingabo ziwe zose n’igihugu ciwe. Muze mumukorere nk’ivyo mwakoreye Sihoni umwami w’Abamori, yaganza i Heshiboni.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " Imana yacu aduha intsinzi kuri Ogi umwami w’i Bashani no ku ngabo ziwe zose. Twarabatikije ntitwasigaza n’umuntu n’umwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ico gihe twafashe ibisagara vyiwe vyose. Mu bisagara mirongo itandatu bari bafise nta na kimwe tutabanyaze, mu ntara yose ya Arugobu, mu bwami bwa Ogi i Bashani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ivyo bisagara vyose vyari bikingiwe n’inzitiro ndende z’ibihome hamwe n’inzugi zikomeye n’ivyugazo vyazo, hakaba kandi hariho n’imihana myinshi itagira inzitiro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bose twarabatikije nk’uko twabigize kuri Sihoni umwami w’i Heshiboni, tugatikiza ibisagara vyose n’ababibamwo: abagabo, abagore n’abana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ariko ibitungwa vyabo n’ivyo twanyaze mu bisagara vyabo twarabitwaye biba ivyacu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko dufata ibihugu vy’abo bami babiri b’Abamori baba mu buseruko bwa Yorodani, uhereye ku kagezi ka Arunoni ugashika kure ku musozi Herumoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abanyesidoni uwo musozi Herumoni bawita Siriyoni, Abamori na bo bakawita Seniri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Twafashe ibisagara biri mu biyaya vyose, dufata n’intara ya Gileyadi yose, dufata n’i Bashani hose gushika kure ahitwa Saleka na Edireyi, ibisagara vy’umwami Ogi w’i Bashani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umwami Ogi w’i Bashani ni we wenyene yari agisigaye mu Barefayimu. Uburiri bwiwe bwari bukozwe mu vyuma, bukagira ingero z’igice c’ukuboko icenda",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3:11",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ni nk’imetero 4.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " z’uburebure n’ingero z’igice c’ukuboko zine",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3:11",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ni nk’imetero 1,8.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " z’ubwaguke. Buracari i Raba ho mu Bamoni gushika n’ubu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu ntara twegukiye ico gihe, umuryango wa Reyubeni n’uwa Gadi ni yo nahaye intara y’amaja ruguru ya Aroweri, uciye ku kagezi ka Arunoni, ugashiramwo n’igice c’intara irimwo imisozi miremire y’i Gileyadi, hamwe n’ibisagara vyaho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Igice ca Gileyadi cari gisigaye hamwe n’intara yose ya Bashani, ari bwo bwami bwa Ogi, nahahaye igice c’umuryango wa Manase. (Iyo ntara yose y’i Arugobu i Bashani kera yari izwi nk’intara y’Abarefayimu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yayiro, wo mu ruvyaro rwa Manase, afata intara yose ya Arugobu, ari ho hitwa Bashani, gushika ku rubibe rw’Abageshuri n’Abamayaka; yaciye imwitirirwa, ni co gituma gushika n’ubu yitwa Havoti Yayiro.) ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gileyadi nahahaye umuryango wa Makiri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 3:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ariko, imiryango ya Reyubeni n’iya Gadi nayihaye intara iva i Gileyadi, ikamanuka igashika ku kagezi k’uruzi Arunoni (nko hagati y’ako kagezi ni ho hari urubibe), kandi hirya ku ruzi Yaboki ni ho hari urubibe rw’Abamoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 3:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Urubibe rwabo rwo mu burengero ni uruzi Yorodani mu kiyaya Araba, uvuye i Kinereti gushika ku kiyaga Araba, ari co Kiyaga c’Umunyu, ukamanuka hepfo y’umusozi Pisiga mu buseruko.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
